# Density Compare
# Magnesium (Mg) — real density 1.738 g/cm³. equal masses: Magnesium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Magnesium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 16.6mm color: #8aff00 at (-20mm, 8.3mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 13.9 g — the water cube is the reference
